WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.075
Section 2: File complaints with independent officers of Parliament.

00:00:05.025 --> 00:00:09.375
The Commissioner of Lobbying investigates lobbying violations.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:13.175
The Ethics Commissioner handles conflicts of interest.

00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:16.812
The Auditor General audits financial misconduct.

00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:21.275
The Information Commissioner enforces access to information.

00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:26.062
File with the right body for the right issue — you can file with more than one.
